{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t屯門鳴琴路早上有兩架巴士相撞，9人受輕傷，包括兩名巴士司機。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發在早上8時16分，當時兩架九巴在鳴琴路往良景邨方向行駛，其後相撞，傷者均清醒，在現場先接受治理。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:41:15.340138+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:16:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:07.169863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:37:54.854335+00:00","content_hash":"45b76e5be5a215990108506cfe49c7d965f09dd100da12a189954834dc1a6779","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}